.TH NEW-SITEHOSTING 1 "October 2026" "Noble Factor" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
New-SiteHosting \- create a DevLore site's whole hosting: its Azure resources, then its GitHub repository's configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B New-SiteHosting
.RB [ \-h | \-\-help ]
.B \-\-name
.I project
.B \-\-domain
.I domain
.B \-\-repo
.I owner/repo
.RB [ \-\-default\-branch
.IR branch ]
.RB [ \-\-skip\-azure ]
.RB [ \-\-skip\-github ]
.RB [ \-\-dry\-run ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B New-SiteHosting
checks that az and gh are logged in and the repository can be seen, asks for confirmation, and runs three phases:
.IP 1. 3
.BR New-AzureStaticWebApp (1),
beside it in
.IR bin/ ,
capturing its output to read back the secrets by their labels;
.IP 2. 3
.BR Set-GitHubRepository (1),
with those secrets in its environment;
.IP 3. 3
a check that the resource group and the Static Web App exist, and a count of the repository's secrets and rulesets.
.PP
It ends with a summary and the next steps: the DNS record, the
.B az staticwebapp hostname set
command that registers the domain, the first deploy, and the stakeholders to invite.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show this manual page and exit.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-name " " \fIproject\fR
The project's name, from which the Azure resources are named. Required.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-domain " " \fIdomain\fR
The custom domain. Required.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-repo " " \fIowner/repo\fR
The site's repository. Required.
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-default\-branch " " \fIbranch\fR
The default branch. Default: develop.
.TP
.B \-\-skip\-azure
Skip phase 1.
.TP
.B \-\-skip\-github
Skip phase 2.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Say what each phase would run, and change nothing.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success \- the hosting exists.
.TP
.B 64
Usage error \- a missing or invalid option.
.TP
.B 69
A tool it needs is not on PATH, or a login or the repository is not available.
.TP
.B 75
Not confirmed; nothing was changed.
.TP
.B 72
Critical file missing \- \fBDeclare-BashScript\fR is not on PATH; deploy the base layer, NobleFactor/noblefactor-engprod.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
bin/New-SiteHosting --name devlore-site --domain devlore.noblefactor.com \\
    --repo NobleFactor/devlore.noblefactor.com
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR New-AzureStaticWebApp (1),
.BR Set-GitHubRepository (1),
.BR az (1),
.BR gh (1)
